# Testing

No test runner exists (backend script exits 1; mobile has no Jest/Detox). Choosing a framework is a **Pending Decision**. Do not add a runner unless the task is to add tests.

## Completion bar

Never claim done without reporting: tests executed, passed, failed, skipped, remaining risks. If tests cannot run, say why.

## When tests exist, cover at least

- `guest_admin` writes → 403
- Employee cannot read another employee’s leave/attendance
- Employee cannot GET medical documents
- Leave overlap (once blocking statuses are signed)
- Medical required when medical leave exceeds two days (MED-12 still Open)
- Check-out without check-in / double punch according to the **signed** punch policy
- Approved leave marks attendance On Leave (INT-01); do not silently overwrite existing punches (INT-03)
- Do not invent a stored “Unauthorized Absence” status

Manual verification of mobile flows is acceptable until a UI test stack exists.
